{"id":625,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"キリスト教教育で社会に奉仕する心を育む","feature_description":"関東学院はキリスト教に基づく教育を掲げ、「人になれ 奉仕せよ」を建学の精神として、人や社会に尽くす姿勢を育みます。中高6年間の一貫教育では、礼拝を日々の学びに位置づけ、仲間と挑戦する部活動や探究、国際教育にも取り組みます。知識の習得だけでなく、他者を尊重し、社会と関わる姿勢を育てる教育を行っています。学校生活全体でその実践を重ねています。","clubs":[{"id":13726,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kantogakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club-activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13727,"name":"硬式テニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kantogakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club-activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13728,"name":"サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kantogakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club-activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13729,"name":"少林寺拳法","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kantogakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club-activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13730,"name":"水泳","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kantogakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club-activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13731,"name":"ソフトテニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kantogakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club-activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13732,"name":"卓球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kantogakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club-activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13733,"name":"ダンス（HULA）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kantogakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club-activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13734,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kantogakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club-activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13735,"name":"バドミントン","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kantogakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club-activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13736,"name":"バレーボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kantogakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club-activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13737,"name":"ハンドボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kantogakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club-activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id